Subject: arm64: dts: exynos7870-on7xelte: eMMC to idle on restart

Opt the eMMC host into the CMD0-on-restart behaviour of the previous
patch: vmmc/vqmmc are always-on and RST_n_FUNCTION is not enabled on this
board, so nothing else returns the device to its power-up state between
Linux and the boot loaders. Without 0002 the property is ignored.

Against: linux v7.3.4 + 0001-0017 + 0001-0002 of this directory.
License: GPL-2.0 (kernel DTS).

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos7870-on7xelte.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos7870-on7xelte.dts
@@ -862,6 +862,7 @@
 	samsung,dw-mshc-sdr-timing = <0 4>;
 	samsung,dw-mshc-ddr-timing = <2 4>;
 	non-removable;
+	mmc-go-idle-on-restart;

 	status = "okay";
 };
